{
    "title": "Fairytale Color by number game",
    "description": "\"Fairytale Color\" - A Wonderland of Pixel Art and Joyful Painting\r\n\r\nEmbark on a magical journey with \"Fairytale Color,\" the ultimate coloring experience that blends the charm of pixel art with the festive spirit of Christmas.Unleash your creativity and immerse yourself in the world of delightful drawings and vibrant colors.This free-to-play puzzle game is designed to spread happiness and artistic inspiration.\r\n\r\n- Artistic Adventure:\r\nEngage in a mesmerizing artistic adventure as you navigate through a vast collection of coloring pages.Discover a rich variety of themes, from fairytale landscapes to adorable animals, and unlock new levels of imagination with every stroke of the virtual brush.\"Fairytale Color\" offers a dynamic canvas for both beginners and experienced artists.\r\n\r\n- Countless Colors:\r\nExpress yourself with an extensive palette of colors.Choose from a myriad of shades to breathe life into your creations.The game provides a diverse selection of hues, ensuring that every artwork reflects your unique style.With \"Fairytale Color,\" the possibilities are as endless as your imagination.\r\n\r\n- Numbered Magic:\r\nEmbrace the magic of numbered coloring pages, adding an extra layer of challenge and excitement to your artistic journey.Each number corresponds to a specific color, turning the coloring process into a strategic puzzle.Watch as your masterpiece comes to life, pixel by pixel, unveiling the hidden beauty within.\r\n\r\n- Coloring Book Extravaganza:\r\n\"Dive into the enchanting world of \"Fairytale Color,\" where every tap of the screen unveils a new page of artistic possibilities.The game serves as a virtual coloring book, offering a vast selection of pages that cater to diverse tastes and preferences.\r\n\r\n- Gameplay That Sparks Joy:\r\nEngage in a happy and fulfilling gaming experience with \"Fairytale Color.\"Whether you're a casual player looking for a relaxing pastime or an art enthusiast seeking a digital canvas, this game promises to spark joy and satisfaction with every stroke.\r\n\r\n- Creativity:\r\nImmerse yourself in a festival of creativity where every painting is a celebration of artistic expression.\"Fairytale Color\" captures the essence of joy and festivity, making it the perfect companion for both solo relaxation and shared moments with friends and family.\r\n\r\n- Free to Play, Free to Create:\r\nExperience the freedom of creativity without any constraints.\"Fairytale Color\" is not only a game but a platform for self-expression.Enjoy the freedom to draw, paint, and create without limitations, making it accessible to everyone.\r\n\r\nIn conclusion, \"Fairytale Color\" is more than just a coloring game;it's a celebration of art and joy.Immerse yourself in a world where pixels meet creativity, and every stroke paints a picture of happiness.Download \"Fairytale Color\" now and let the artistic adventure begin!",
    "descriptionHTML": "&quot;Fairytale Color&quot; - A Wonderland of Pixel Art and Joyful Painting<br><br>Embark on a magical journey with &quot;Fairytale Color,&quot; the ultimate coloring experience that blends the charm of pixel art with the festive spirit of Christmas.Unleash your creativity and immerse yourself in the world of delightful drawings and vibrant colors.This free-to-play puzzle game is designed to spread happiness and artistic inspiration.<br><br>- Artistic Adventure:<br>Engage in a mesmerizing artistic adventure as you navigate through a vast collection of coloring pages.Discover a rich variety of themes, from fairytale landscapes to adorable animals, and unlock new levels of imagination with every stroke of the virtual brush.&quot;Fairytale Color&quot; offers a dynamic canvas for both beginners and experienced artists.<br><br>- Countless Colors:<br>Express yourself with an extensive palette of colors.Choose from a myriad of shades to breathe life into your creations.The game provides a diverse selection of hues, ensuring that every artwork reflects your unique style.With &quot;Fairytale Color,&quot; the possibilities are as endless as your imagination.<br><br>- Numbered Magic:<br>Embrace the magic of numbered coloring pages, adding an extra layer of challenge and excitement to your artistic journey.Each number corresponds to a specific color, turning the coloring process into a strategic puzzle.Watch as your masterpiece comes to life, pixel by pixel, unveiling the hidden beauty within.<br><br>- Coloring Book Extravaganza:<br>&quot;Dive into the enchanting world of &quot;Fairytale Color,&quot; where every tap of the screen unveils a new page of artistic possibilities.The game serves as a virtual coloring book, offering a vast selection of pages that cater to diverse tastes and preferences.<br><br>- Gameplay That Sparks Joy:<br>Engage in a happy and fulfilling gaming experience with &quot;Fairytale Color.&quot;Whether you&#39;re a casual player looking for a relaxing pastime or an art enthusiast seeking a digital canvas, this game promises to spark joy and satisfaction with every stroke.<br><br>- Creativity:<br>Immerse yourself in a festival of creativity where every painting is a celebration of artistic expression.&quot;Fairytale Color&quot; captures the essence of joy and festivity, making it the perfect companion for both solo relaxation and shared moments with friends and family.<br><br>- Free to Play, Free to Create:<br>Experience the freedom of creativity without any constraints.&quot;Fairytale Color&quot; is not only a game but a platform for self-expression.Enjoy the freedom to draw, paint, and create without limitations, making it accessible to everyone.<br><br>In conclusion, &quot;Fairytale Color&quot; is more than just a coloring game;it&#39;s a celebration of art and joy.Immerse yourself in a world where pixels meet creativity, and every stroke paints a picture of happiness.Download &quot;Fairytale Color&quot; now and let the artistic adventure begin!",
